# Instant UI Feedback

With `useOptimistic`, you can update the UI immediately while the Server Action runs in the background.

```jsx
const [optimisticMessages, addOptimisticMessage] = useOptimistic(
  messages,
  (state, newMessage) => [...state, newMessage]
);
```

This makes your app feel instantaneous. If the server action fails, the UI rolls back automatically.
